-- Migration: Seed the Estimation Konva print-copy template (print_templates, category 16)
-- Source: built interactively in the print-templates V2 (Konva Canvas) designer, replicating
-- estimation/print/est_print_2.php's legacy thermal-copy layout field-for-field (header,
-- customer line, rates, items table, tax lines, OLD ESTIMATE table, Sales/Purchase/Grand
-- Total summary, EMP line, final total) including est_print_2.php's exact conditional
-- show/hide rules (has_items, total_old_metal, show_sales_purchase_summary).
-- Safe: WHERE NOT EXISTS prevents duplicates on re-run.
-- Inserted INACTIVE (is_active = 0) — activating a template changes what a client's
-- estimation prints actually show, so that stays an explicit admin action in the
-- print-templates UI, not something a migration should force silently. Also requires
-- ret_settings.estimation_template_based = 3 to take effect once activated (see
-- 20260419_000001_add_estimation_template_setting.sql, seeded disabled/0 by default).

-- UP
